        <td class="NewsText" style="font-size: 15px">David Wyckoff has announced the availability of updated builds of <a href="lilidog">Lilidog</a>, a set of Debian-based desktop Linux distributions featuring either a customised Openbox window manager, or a (newly-introduced) Noctalia shell that runs on top of the labwc compositor: "<span class="Quote">New release 26.11.25 - Lilidog, Beardog, Waydog and Waydog Noctalia. All builds based from Debian point release 13.8. Lots of improvements, fixes and adjustments this round, with the main change being the addition of a Waydog Noctalia edition. Currently, Noctalia 5.6.0, though you can enable the repository to update at will if desired. To experiment with the Noctalia themes, open Thunar (something where you can see the highlight colors), and place it in a lower corner of the screen to observe changes. Then open the wallpaper dialog (second from left icon in panel), and change from 'Custom' to wallpaper. The initial change will be obvious, and will serve to give you the idea of what to expect. Change backgrounds using either the wallpaper dialog, or try 'Super + v' to toggle through the wallpapers at will. There is also the default Noctalia built-in theme, and the different community themes.</span>" Here is the full <a href="https://sourceforge.net/p/lilidog/discussion/updates/thread/89d02e41c9/?page=7#17c6">release announcement</a>. <a href="https://sourceforge.net/projects/lilidog/files/Releases/">Download (SHA256</a>, <a href="table.php?distribution=lilidog&pkglist=true&version=26.11.25#pkglist">pkglist</a>, username/password: user/live): <a href="https://sourceforge.net/projects/lilidog/files/Releases/Lilidog-Trixie-26.11.25-amd64.hybrid.iso">Lilidog-Trixie-26.11.25-amd64.hybrid.iso</a> (X.Org with Openbox, 2,072MB), <a href="https://sourceforge.net/projects/lilidog/files/Releases/Waydog-Trixie-26.11.25-amd64.hybrid.iso">Waydog-Trixie-26.11.25-amd64.hybrid.iso</a> (Wayland with Openbox, 1,851MB), <a href="https://sourceforge.net/projects/lilidog/files/Releases/Waydog-Trixie-Noctalia-26.11.25-amd64.hybrid.iso">Waydog-Trixie-Noctalia-26.11.25-amd64.hybrid.iso</a> (Wayland with labwc + Noctalia, 1,872MB), <a href="https://sourceforge.net/projects/lilidog/files/Releases/Beardog-Trixie-26.11.25-amd64.hybrid.iso">Beardog-Trixie-26.11.25-amd64.hybrid.iso</a> (No X, 1,797MB).</td>
