        <td class="NewsText" style="font-size: 15px">System76, Inc. has announced the release of <a href="popos">Pop!_OS</a> 26.04, a major new release of the company's Ubuntu-based Linux distribution featuring the COSMIC desktop. One of the interesting new features of the product is Constellations, a brand-new themes manager: "<span class="Quote">Pop!_OS 26.04 LTS is here, after nearly a year of thoughtful feature development. With tons of improvements, new features and the usual bug fixes, Pop!_OS 26.04 LTS feels right at home from the first boot. And when you're ready to make it your own, you can customize it until it looks and feels exactly the way you think a desktop should. It all starts with Constellations. What are Constellations? Constellations are COSMIC's all-in-one bundled themes. With a single click you can change the wallpaper, accent colors, icons, and fonts. It's literally a one-click switch for a full aesthetic change of your desktop. Instead of having to go to Desktop, Wallpaper, then Desktop, Appearance, then Desktop Panel, then Desktop Dock, then Desktop Window Management, all you do is go to Settings, Desktop, Appearance, select between dark or light mode, enable or disable automatic mode switching, and then select your theme. You can also apply the Frosted Glass effect to a Constellation and edit nearly every aspect of a Constellation.</span>" Read the detailed <a href="https://system76.com/blog/post/pop_os-26-04-lts-has-landed">release announcement</a> for more information and screenshots. <a href="https://system76.com/download-pop/">Download (SHA256</a>, <a href="table.php?distribution=popos&pkglist=true&version=26.04#pkglist">pkglist</a>): <a href="https://iso.pop-os.org/26.04/amd64/generic/8/pop-os_26.04_amd64_generic_8.iso">pop-os_26.04_amd64_generic_8.iso</a> (2,941MB), <a href="https://iso.pop-os.org/26.04/amd64/nvidia/8/pop-os_26.04_amd64_nvidia_8.iso">pop-os_26.04_amd64_nvidia_8.iso</a> (3,593MB), <a href="https://iso.pop-os.org/26.04/