        <td class="NewsText" style="font-size: 15px">The Rocky Linux team has announced the release of <a href="rocky">Rocky</a> Linux 10.3, the latest and greatest version of the project's open-source enterprise operating system designed to be 100% bug-for-bug compatible with Red Hat Enterprise Linux: "<span class="Quote">We are pleased to announce the general availability of Rocky Linux 10.3. Updated installation media, container images, cloud images and live images are available from the Rocky Linux downloads webpage. Rocky Linux 10.3 ships with kernel 6.12 and is available for x86-64-v3, aarch64, riscv64, ppc64le (POWER10 and later) and s390x (IBM z15 and later). Compilers and developer tools: GCC Toolset 16, providing GCC 16.2 and Binutils 2.46 as an Application Stream, alongside the system compiler, it adds several C++26 features, including Reflection and Contracts, and changes the default C++ standard to -std=gnu++20; LLVM Toolset 22.1.8, updating the toolset from the LLVM 21 release series; Rust 1.97, applying changes from upstream Rust 1.93 through 1.97 and switching to the v0 symbol mangling format for more accurate demangling of generic types; golang 1.27.3, adding generic methods, the encoding/json/v2 packages, and the crypto/mldsa package implementing post-quantum ML-DSA signatures; gdb 17.2, with support for debugging x86-64 CET shadow stacks and AArch64 Guarded Control Stacks....</span>" See the <a href="https://rockylinux.org/news/rocky-linux-10-3-ga-release">release announcement</a> and the detailed <a href="https://docs.rockylinux.org/releases/release_notes/10_3/">release notes</a> for more information. <a href="https://rockylinux.org/download">Download</a>: <a href="https://download.rockylinux.org/pub/rocky/10.3/isos/x86_64/Rocky-10.3-x86_64-dvd1.iso">Rocky-10.3-x86_64-dvd1.iso</a> (10,322MB, <a href="https://download.rockylinux.org/pub/rocky/10.3/isos/x86_64/Rocky-10.3-20261112.0-x86_64-dvd1.torrent">torrent</a>, <a href="https://download.rockylinux.org/pub/rocky/10.3/isos/x86_64/CHECKSUM">SHA256</a>, <a href="https://download.rockylinux.org/pub/rocky/10.3/isos/x86_64/CHECKSUM.asc">signature</a>, <a href="table.php?distribution=rocky&pkglist=true&version=10.3#pkglist">pkglist</a>), <a href="https://download.rockylinux.org/pub/rocky/10.3/isos/aarch64/Rocky-10.3-aarch64-dvd1.iso">Rocky-10.3-aarch64-dvd1.iso</a> (9,762MB, <a href="https://download.rockylinux.org/pub/rocky/10.3/isos/aarch64/Rocky-10.3-aarch64-dvd.torrent">torrent</a>, <a href="https://download.rockylinux.org/pub/rocky/10.3/isos/aarch64/CHECKSUM">SHA256</a>, <a href="https://download.rockylinux.org/pub/rocky/10.3/isos/aarch64/CHECKSUM.asc">signature</a>).</td>
